card.text:
Use Timing [Main Phase]

[Encore] {2}
Search your deck for 1 card, shuffle your deck, then put that card on top of your deck.

Use Timing [Main Phase] [Attack Phase]
        
During your opponent's turn, this ARTS's use cost becomes {B}{B}{B}
Target 1 SIGNI in your trash, and put it onto your field.

Use Timing [Main Phase]
		
[Encore] {1}{U}
Target 1 SPELL in your opponent's trash, and use it as though it were from your hand without paying its costs and ignoring its limiting conditions.  This turn, if that SPELL would move from the Check Zone to a different Zone, exclude it from the game instead.

Use Timing [Main Phase] [Attack Phase] 
		
[Bet]:  {Coin}{Coin}
Search your deck for 1 SIGNI with (Rise), put it onto your field, then shuffle your deck.  That SIGNI's [Enter] abilities do not activate.  Then, target 1 SIGNI on your opponent's field with power lower than or equal to the power of the SIGNI that entered your field, and vanish it.  If you bet, instead vanish all SIGNI on your opponent's field with power lower than or equal to the power of the SIGNI that entered your field.

Use Timing [Main Phase]

[Bet]: {Coin}
Search your deck for 1 white SIGNI, reveal it, and add it to your hand.  Shuffle your deck.  If you bet, additionally your deck for 1 SIGNI, reveal it, and add it to your hand.  Shuffle your deck.

Use Timing [Attack Phase] 

[Bet]: {Coin}{Coin}{Coin}
Target 1 SIGNI on your opponent's field, down it, then draw 1 card.  If you bet, instead target 3 SIGNI on your opponent's field, down them, then draw 3 cards.

Use Timing [Attack Phase] 

[Bet]: {Coin}{Coin}{Coin}
Target 1 SIGNI on your opponent's field, down it, then draw 1 card.  If you bet, instead target 3 SIGNI on your opponent's field, down them, then draw 3 cards.

Use Timing [Main Phase]
[Bet]: {Coin}{Coin}{Coin}
If you bet, this ARTS's use cost is decreased by {1}. Choose up to two: - Target 1 SIGNI on your field, and it gets [Double Crush] until end of turn. - This turn, the next time your LRIG attacks, during that attack, your opponent can't [Guard]. - If your opponent's center LRIG is level 3 or higher, your opponent puts 3 cards from their Ener Zone into the trash. (If there are 2 or less cards, put all of them into the trash.)

Use Timing [Main Phase]
[Bet]: {Coin}{Coin}{Coin}
If you bet, this ARTS's use cost is decreased by {1}. Choose up to two: - Target 1 SIGNI on your field, and it gets [Double Crush] until end of turn. - This turn, the next time your LRIG attacks, during that attack, your opponent can't [Guard]. - If your opponent's center LRIG is level 3 or higher, your opponent puts 3 cards from their Ener Zone into the trash. (If there are 2 or less cards, put all of them into the trash.)
